      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mange ke Daudi ku jego mir udul gikoyo jumoko mi timotim m’i kind wot Asaf, man pa Heman, man pa Yeduthun, ma biewo lembe ku nanga, kud adungu, man kud umbukulumbu: man wel mi ju m’utimo tic calku timotim migi gi eni: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi wot Asaf: Zakur, man Yusuf, man Nethania, man Acarela, ma wod Asaf, the cing Asaf, m’uewo lembe calku lembang’ola p’ubimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa Yeduthun; wot Yeduthun gi eni: Gedalia, man Zeri, man Yecaya, man Hacabia, man Matithia, gin abusiel, the cing’ weggi ma Yeduthun ku nanga, m’eewo lembe i mio foyofoc man paku Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa Heman; wot Heman gi eni; Bukia, man Matania, man Uziel, man Cebuel, man Yerimoth, man Hanania, man Hanani, man Eliatha, man Gidalti, man Romamti-ezer, man Yocbekaca, man Malothi, man Hothir, man Mahazioth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni ceke gi wot Heman ma jaeulembe p’ubimo i lembe pa Mungu, kara uting’ tung malu. Man Mungu mio wote apar wi ang’wen ku nyige adek ni Heman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni ceke gini the cing’ weggi mi wer i ot pa Yehova, kud umbukulumbu, man adungu, ku nanga, pi timotim i ot pa Mungu; Asaf, man Yeduthun, man Heman ma gini the lembang’ola p’ubimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man welgi, karacelo ku uturneggi ma juponjogi i wer ma ni Yehova, en e dhanu ceke ma gi riek, gi dak ario ku pier abora wi abora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man gigoyo gagi mi tic migi, ceke acel, ma thindho calu ma dongo, japonji calu japonja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
